{"id": "De2Xgtitgj_", "title": "Video by gwendolyneem", "description": "💾 Save these prompts 👇🏻\n\nI started using Instagram with 0 social media knowledge. My Reels used to get under 100 views.\n\nThen I stopped using Claude like a search bar and started using it like my Instagram strategist.\n\n***The results***\n🤭2.5 mio views \n📈 tens of leads daily\n\nThese are 7 of the prompts I used 👇🏻\n\n1️⃣ **Find what’s working**\n\n“Analyze my last 10 Reels and identify the patterns behind the highest-performing ones.”\n\n2️⃣ **Find better ideas**\n\n“Give me 20 Reel ideas for [my audience] based on their biggest problems, goals and frustrations.”\n\n3️⃣ **Fix my hooks**\n\n“Rewrite this hook 10 ways. Make it specific, curiosity-driven and understandable in under 2 seconds.”\n\n4️⃣ **Replicate winners**\n\n“This Reel performed well: [paste]. Give me 10 new ideas using the same underlying format without copying it.”\n\n5️⃣ **Make it shareable**\n\n“Turn this idea into a Reel people will want to send to another business owner.”\n\n6️⃣ **Find content gaps**\n\n“Analyze my content and tell me what my ideal audience needs to hear that I’m currently NOT posting about.”\n\n7️⃣ **Plan what to post next**\n\n“Based on these Reel results [paste metrics], tell me the next 5 content experiments I should test and why.”\n\nThat’s the difference.\n\nI stopped asking Claude: “What should I post?”\n\nAnd started giving it the context + data to actually help me make decisions.\n\n💬 Comment GROW and I’ll send you how I set up Claude for my business.\n\n➕ Follow @gwendolyneem for more ways to put AI to work in your business.\n\n#ClaudeAI #AIMarketing #InstagramGrowth #Solopreneur ContentStrategy\n\nClaude, Claude prompts, Instagram growth, Instagram Reels, AI for business, AI marketing, content strategy, Reel ideas, viral hooks, Instagram strategy, solopreneur, solo founder, small business, content creation, social media strategy, AI tools, business automation, Instagram prompts, content mark